WEBVTT

00:36:01.913 --> 00:36:03.621
WorkLife is hosted by me, Adam Grant,

00:36:03.996 --> 00:36:06.204
it shows produced by Ted
with Transmitter Media.

00:36:06.538 --> 00:36:10.538
Our team includes Colin Helmes Credico
and Dan O'Donnell, Joanne DeLuna,

00:36:10.746 --> 00:36:14.371
Grace Rubenstein, Michelle Quint,
Ben Ben Chang and Anna Feeling.

00:36:15.121 --> 00:36:19.079
This episode was produced by Constanza
Gallardo, our shows mixed by Rick Juan.

00:36:19.413 --> 00:36:23.788
Our fact checker is Paul Durbin, original
music by Hartsdale Sue and Alison Layton.

00:36:23.788 --> 00:36:29.038
Brown had stories produced by Pineapple
Street Studios special thanks to our

00:36:29.038 --> 00:36:34.621
sponsors LinkedIn, Logitech, Morgan
Stanley, Sappi and Verizon